  "cautions": [
    "Author component hits and NMS/greedy box hits are different metrics with different denominators; do not mix their totals.",
    "rate_analysis uses original-config camera groups; attribution uses fresh-profile groups. All-camera rate summaries avoid this grouping mismatch.",
    "Clip-matched FA thresholds and pooled FA thresholds are different operating policies; pooled recall is not uniformly lower, so their difference alone does not establish a universal calibration gap.",
    "The fresh camera grouping changes DJI_0257_2 from static to moving; apparent camera-group miss-rate ordering reverses under the original grouping.",
    "Frames and components repeat tracks; do not treat counts as independent physical targets or infer statistical significance from raw sample size.",
    "Relative-speed groups depend on estimated homographies and annotations; classification does not prove why an individual detection failed.",
    "The actual reproduction has 11300 components and 1334 misses at 1e-5; the released log has 11303 and 1362. These are not identical replications."
  ],
  "suggested_claim": "官方模型对近静止目标的召回较弱，但近静止目标仅占残余漏检的一部分，且证据集中于少数场景。MXC针对该困难子集提出场景校准机制；相机补偿的收益和运动 exemplar 的额外贡献仍需独立验证。"
}
